Braith Vanderbilt is the chief executive of [[Org/Omnivox/index|Omnivox]], the corporation of [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)|Syrin]]. He speaks for the company at [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)/Terminus|Media Con]] and judges its cosplay competition, and he is a true believer in the media Omnivox makes.
